Package: secret-stripper
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: libx11-6, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libgtk-3-0, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: On-demand clipboard PII/secret redactor
 Secret Stripper is a one-shot CLI that strips secrets and PII from the
 clipboard on demand. A global hotkey runs the redactor; it reads the
 selection or clipboard, redacts API keys / tokens / private keys / PII,
 writes the redacted text back, and exits.
